OL,3,GNEWSABank cash machines ripped out and
OL,4,Ataken away in horsebox
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo cash machines have been ripped out
OL,7,Fof the walls of a bank in southern
OL,8,FScotland and taken away on a horsebox
OL,9,Fin an early morning raid.
OL,11,FPeebles High Street has been closed to
OL,12,Fvehicles after the Royal Bank of
OL,13,FScotland branch on the town's Eastgate
OL,14,Fwas targeted at about 03:00.
OL,16,FA telescopic forklift, used to ram the
OL,17,Fbuilding, was left abandoned in the
OL,18,Fstreet.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
